# Model file of the extremes set XSET-1: FS242 = the from-scratch paper run, chain gs_b32_r4000_lr5e4 (batch 32, lr 5e-4,
# 4,000 km dynamic crops, QK gains free, 12 outputs: 10u 10v 2d 2t msl skt sp tcw cp tp z_500 t_850; code ds-trunk 8c12d4dec).
# Values from the from-scratch thread, 17 Nov 2026 11:41 UTC (its Mac session read them on Jupiter); proven only by the smoke.
# RUN_DIR is a made folder of links: run_e9d53bb9 -> the chain run directory (EMA exports every 5,000 steps),
# raw_b32 -> the raw by-step copies kept every 25,000 steps. Steps 25k, 50k, 75k, ... resolve both files. For any other
# step (the freeze export included) give a raw file explicitly: RAW_FILE=$S/paper/warm/b32_step50000.ckpt in front of
# xset_row.sh; the raw file only builds the trainer, the EMA weights are then loaded strictly.
# No crop override is needed: training.crop acts on the training loader and loss only; graph and model are global.
S=/e/data1/jureap-data/ecmwf/users/jdumont/sandbox/20261111-gs-global-crop
MODEL_NAME=gs_b32_r4000_lr5e4
RUN_DIR=$S/paper/xset_run
CFG_DIR=$S/configs
CFG_NAME=gs_b32_r4000_lr5e4
EXPECT_CODE=sandbox/20261111-gs-global-crop/code/anemoi-core
CODE_ROOT=$S/code/anemoi-core
CODE_SHA_FILE=$S/CODE_PIN
DATASETS_SHA_FILE=$S/DATASETS_PIN
ANCHOR=20230101:24
